# Firdoch Core (Changeling, CR 702.73a) is every creature type, and as a Kindred (CR 308, 205.3m) a permanent that has
# creature types without being a creature: Harmonized Crescendo, choosing Zubera - a type neither Ornithopter (Thopter)
# nor any card in the game is - draws one card for the Core and none for the Ornithopter. Bot1 casts the Core on turn 1
# (Jet, Ruby and Pearl), and on turn 3 pays Crescendo's {4}{U}{U} with the Island, Mox Sapphire, those three Moxen and the
# Core's own mana. The Core is still a noncreature artifact: its types are Kindred and Artifact only.

